{"id":"606124","name":"培根煎土豆泥","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/606124/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"培根","amount":"4片"},{"name":"土豆（小的）","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"熟蛋黄","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"土豆煮熟，去皮。","img":"images/606124/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"压成泥。","img":"images/606124/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放食盐。","img":"images/606124/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放蛋黄和黑胡椒粉。","img":"images/606124/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/606124/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"取培根，一分为二，也可以一分为三。","img":"images/606124/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把土豆泥团成比培根绝宽的圆柱体，能做成方形更好，放培根上卷起来。","img":"images/606124/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"全部做好。","img":"images/606124/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅烧热，放培根卷。","img":"images/606124/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"一边煎金黄就翻面。","img":"images/606124/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"继续翻面。","img":"images/606124/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"培根全部煎金黄即可。","img":"images/606124/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/606124/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"小孩子就这样吃就很香，成人可以搭配蘸料。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}